            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The mix of Swiss access transmission network, fixed.\n\n# Included processes\nThe dataset represents the optic fibre network in Switzerland. The reference year for network traffic is 2014. The equipment is based on information from 2010 but is deemed the most actual. A lifetime of 6 years is assumed. Amount of electricity consumed is based on the network electricity intensity (kWh/GB) information from the Telefonica Access Network.. The functional unit = 1 GB.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
